+- Settings preview images shipped per quality level; a real-time preview viewport.
+- FSR 4 / DLSS 4 multi-frame-generation modes as rows (variables to confirm against the current vendor plugins).
+- Pending (Apply Button) upscaler changes: the mode list follows the applied upscaler until Apply.
+- Touch: swipe between tabs, larger touch targets preset.
